2026-11-06T02:58:46.4132428Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4132607Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4132805Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4133071Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4133525Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4143117Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4143751Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4152898Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4153578Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:58:46.4153839Z 
